    <!-- ========================================================
         ABOUT ME & PERSONAL DETAILS SECTION
         ======================================================== -->
    <section class="section about-section" id="about">
      <div class="container">
        <!-- Section Header -->
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-pill">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-id-badge"></i> Personal Overview
          </div>
          <h2 class="section-title">About <span class="gradient-text">Me</span></h2>
          <p class="section-subtitle">
            Get to know my journey, academic background, interests, and what drives my passion for technology.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-grid">
          <!-- Left: Narrative Details -->
          <div class="about-narrative">
            <h3 class="about-greeting">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-compass text-indigo"></i> Driven by curiosity, fueled by code.
            </h3>
            <p>
              Hello! I am a freshman currently pursuing my undergraduate degree in Computer Science and Engineering. My journey with coding started with a simple "Hello World" in Python, and since then, I have been captivated by how lines of code can create software that impacts people worldwide.
            </p>
            <p>
              As a beginner, I am proactive about turning theoretical concepts into real projects. Whether it is understanding algorithms, building pixel-perfect websites with HTML &amp; CSS, or collaborating with peers in coding clubs, I enjoy every step of the learning process.
            </p>

            <!-- Detailed Personal Info Grid -->
            <div class="personal-info-grid">
              <div class="info-item">
                <div class="info-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-check"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <span class="info-label">Full Name</span>
                  <strong class="info-value">Sonu Kumar</strong>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="info-item">
                <div class="info-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <span class="info-label">Current Level</span>
                  <strong class="info-value">1st Year Undergraduate</strong>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="info-item">
                <div class="info-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-language"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <span class="info-label">Languages</span>
                  <strong class="info-value">English, Hindi</strong>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="info-item">
                <div class="info-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-map-location-dot"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <span class="info-label">Location</span>
                  <strong class="info-value">New Delhi, India</strong>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="info-item">
                <div class="info-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope-open-text"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <span class="info-label">Email Status</span>
                  <strong class="info-value">Verified &amp; Active</strong>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="info-item">
                <div class="info-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <span class="info-label">Availability</span>
                  <strong class="info-value text-emerald">Immediate / Part-time</strong>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Right: Key Focus Highlights -->
          <div class="about-highlights">
            <div class="highlight-card">
              <div class="highlight-icon icon-cyan">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="highlight-body">
                <h4>Web Craftsmanship</h4>
                <p>Creating responsive, semantic, and accessible websites utilizing clean HTML5 structure and modern CSS3 animations.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="highlight-card">
              <div class="highlight-icon icon-indigo">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="highlight-body">
                <h4>Data Structures &amp; Problem Solving</h4>
                <p>Sharpening logical thinking with daily practice in basic data structures, time complexity analysis, and algorithms in C++ &amp; Python.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="highlight-card">
              <div class="highlight-icon icon-emerald">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-users-gear"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="highlight-body">
                <h4>Teamwork &amp; Continuous Growth</h4>
                <p>Active participant in campus hackathons, technical societies, and peer mentoring to foster collaborative growth.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="highlight-card">
              <div class="highlight-icon icon-purple">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-brain"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="highlight-body">
                <h4>AI &amp; Emerging Tech Curiosity</h4>
                <p>Exploring the frontiers of machine learning, prompt engineering, and intelligent tools reshaping modern software development.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
